TEXT 104 408 Left 2 ;The plant has the transfer function num=s^2+6s+10 den=s^3+7s+1\nThis is translated with matlab to the state space model \n[a,b,c,d]=tf2ss(nom,den)\nThe differential eqns are:\ndx3/dt = -7x2 -1x1 + u(t) -> u(t) is the input in\ndx2/dt = x3\ndx1/dt = x2\ny = out = 10*x1 + 6*x2 + 1*x3\n \nH(s) = b2*s2+b1*s+b0 /  a3*s3+a2*s2+a1*s+a0    a3=1 (fix) !!\n \na3*x3' = b0*x1+b1*x2+b2*x3--a0*x1-a1*x2-a2*x3 (a2=0 in this case)
TEXT 288 264 Left 2 ;(s^2+6s+10) / (s^3+7s+1)
TEXT 200 344 Left 5 ;StateSpace - Model
TEXT -408 192 Left 2 !.param a0=1 a1=7 a2=0 b0=10 b1=6 b2=1
